englishSenses.definition:
a. Pertaining to, or resembling, the devil
   Mephistopheles, "a crafty, scoffing, relentless fiend;" devilish;
   crafty.

a. Having the toes firmly united together for some
   distance, and without an intermediate web, as the kingfishers;
   gressorial.

imp. & p. p. of Tare
a. Weighed; determined; reduced to equal or standard weight;
   as, tared filter papers, used in weighing precipitates.
